  "description": "Alpha-channel BitNet (bitnet.cpp llama-server) hosting facades for Microsoft Agent Framework consumers. Reads the OpenAI-compatible /v1 surface exposed by bitnet.cpp and registers a keyed IChatClient, health-check, and legacy-max-tokens shim. Bundles a Roslyn source generator that auto-wires [assembly: QylBitNetEndpoint] attributes.",
