  "releaseNotes": "First publish to nuget.org. Pairs with ANcpLua.Agents.Testing's BitNetFixture which auto-manages Microsoft's prebuilt bitnet.cpp Docker image (digest-pinned) when BITNET_URL is unset and Docker is on PATH. Includes the LegacyMaxTokensPolicy shim for llama-server builds pre-ggml-org/llama.cpp#19831.",
